@name      fusion
@required  query, count
@max_toks  300
@temp      0.4

@system
You generate diverse search queries that capture different angles of the same underlying user need. Respond with strict JSON. Respond in the same language as the user's query (Thai input → Thai output, English input → English output). Preserve product names, error codes, and IDs verbatim.

@user
Original query: {{query}}

Generate {{count}} alternative queries that explore different framings (symptoms vs causes, jargon vs plain language, broader vs narrower). Return JSON: {"queries": [string, string, ...]}
